Update 3.0.0 has been released. Here's what was added.

[h1][b]- New mechanic - Cargo Ship:[/b][/h1]

Now a cargo ship can appear in the Hub after returning from a map. The ship will offer a random item for purchase.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400890/dc81f98d02db47024e3f5bcaa64aa3bff91ea6bb.gif[/img]

[h1][b]- Supreme ships added:[/b][/h1]

Now the player will be able to unlock the supreme ships. These ships in addition to being the most powerful, have more laser cannons.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400890/7c3641eed0e212db11567a5e57fdcbd3bc98da01.png[/img]


- 02 new maps;
- New painting;
- New effects;
- New thrusters;
- New shield;
- New bombs
- New laser
- New missions;
- New achievements.

- Bug fixes.

Update 1.1.1 has been released, here is what has been fixed:


- Fixed bug in Hangar's sale button;
- Fixed bug in some ship upgrades in the Hangar;
- Fixed bug in some missions that kept repeating the reward;

Update 1.1.0 consists of the following changes/inclusions:

[b]Changes:[/b]
- Reduction in the price of elemental crystals in the shop;
- Reduction in the price of shot types in the shop.

[b]Additions:[/b]
- New achievement;
- New mission;
- New enemy - Crystal Seeker.

The Crystal Seeker has a chance to spawn on the map and when destroyed will drop an orange crystal worth 1000 crystals.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44400890/c76eae012b8a427520b0c3aab06929be44f8ca2c.gif[/img]

Update 1.0.1 consists of the following changes:

- Improved the description of the controls on the Help/Tutorial screen;
- Reduction in the cost of improving ships;
- Balancing during the first game sessions. Fewer enemy ships will appear while the ship is at level 01;
- Bug fixes.

These changes were applied in the final version of the game and in the Demo.
